<title>SIERRA LEONE: SOCCER-SIERRA LEONE AND GHANA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SIERRA LEONE AND GHANA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>FREETOWN 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sierra Leone and Ghana drew 1-1</p>
<p>draw (halftime 0-1) in a World Cup African zone group five</p>
<p>soccer qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ghana - Abubakar Kamara 23 own goal</p>
<p>Sierra Leone  - Lamin Kamara 88 pen</p>
<p>Attendance - 70,000</p>
</text>
